$----------------------------------------------------------------MDI_HEADER
[MDI_HEADER]
FILE_TYPE     =  'aer'
FILE_VERSION  =  5
FILE_FORMAT   =  'ASCII'
(COMMENTS)
{comment_string)
'CFR25 aero map - DC4192 Concordia Univ FSAE Aero, 6 March 2026 wind tunnel test, 0 deg yaw'
'Source: AEROMAP tab, 0 YAW block (total downforce and drag vs front/rear ride height).'
'Front/rear split fitted from the ten 0 deg yaw ride-height runs on the AeroData tab:'
'  pct_front = 0.750258 - 0.004344*FRH + 0.000657*RRH  (RMS residual 0.0072, max 0.0161).'
'Tunnel reference condition: q = 358.27 Pa, Vinf = 56.2 mph = 90.445 km/h, rho = 1.1352 kg/m^3, AF = 1.0122 m^2.'
